{"track":"r","category":"함수·재귀","level":3,"title":"팩토리얼 (재귀)","desc":"<p><code>n!</code>을 <b>재귀</b>로 구하는 <code>fact_rec(n)</code>을 만드세요. <code>0! = 1</code></p>","solution":"fact_rec <- function(n) {\n  if (n <= 1) {\n    return(1)\n  }\n  n * fact_rec(n - 1)\n}\n","hint":"<p>멈추는 조건(n ≤ 1) 후 <code>n * fact_rec(n - 1)</code>.</p>","tests":[{"call":"fact_rec(0)","expected":1,"visible":true},{"call":"fact_rec(5)","expected":120,"visible":true},{"call":"fact_rec(10)","expected":3628800,"visible":false},{"call":"fact_rec(12)","expected":479001600,"visible":false}],"starter":"fact_rec <- function(n) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-347"}